			"Message": "feat(Common): Add FileWatcherProvider trait and extend DebugService/TerminalProvider\n\n- Add new FileWatcherProvider trait with RegisterWatcher/UnregisterWatcher methods for recursive filesystem watching backed by native OS notifications (inotify/FSEvents/ReadDirectoryChangesW). Events stream to the extension host as `$fileWatcher:event` notifications.\n- Add StopDebugging method to DebugService trait for terminating active debug sessions with DAP disconnect and UI notification.\n- Add ResizeTerminal method to TerminalProvider trait for PTY resizing with SIGWINCH propagation.\n- Update Documentation/Rust submodule to c0ea03f5ac53ebcef1c4ab4f2a30b9e0e1d6cf05\n\nThese additions complete the abstract contracts for file watching, debug session management, and terminal resizing in the Common crate, ready for implementation by Mountain.",
